  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 2280348716097536
    m_Localized: Draw a bridge in your notebook!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58867199228502155
    m_Localized: A houseboat can be a home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58867199228502154
    m_Localized: Goods boats carry many boxes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58867199228502153
    m_Localized: Tourist boats have large windows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58867199228502152
    m_Localized: The river flows into the sea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58867199228502151
    m_Localized: The maps show the meanders of the river.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58867199228502150
    m_Localized: The Seine allows boats to circulate in Paris.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58867199228502149
    m_Localized: Cars cross the river every day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58867199228502148
    m_Localized: Some bridges are intended for pedestrians only.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58867199228502147
    m_Localized: A train bridge must be strong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58867199228502146
    m_Localized: The Seine is very long!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58867199228502145
    m_Localized: Paris is the most beautiful city in the world!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58867199228502144
    m_Localized: I really enjoy cycling along the Seine!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58867199228502143
    m_Localized: Hi!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58867199228502142
    m_Localized: There are many bridges in Paris!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58867199228502141
    m_Localized: La Seine est magnifique!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58867199228502140
    m_Localized: Good morning!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58867199228502139
    m_Localized: The Seine flows into the English Channel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58867199228502138
    m_Localized: It is in the old center of Paris.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58867199228502137
    m_Localized: "There is an island called \xCEle de la Cit\xE9."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58867199228502136
    m_Localized: Look how pretty it is!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58867199228502135
    m_Localized: I did see a dog walking around, yes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58867199228502134
    m_Localized: A dog? There are many dogs here...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58867199228502133
    m_Localized: No, I haven't seen your dog.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58867199228502132
    m_Localized: The Seine flows into the English Channel (a sea) in a northerly
      direction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58867199228502131
    m_Localized: Look at this map of the Seine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58867199228502130
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58867199228502129
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
